art":118.25,"end":120.37,"text":"some information about your preschool, please.","words":[["some",118.25,118.39],["information",118.39,118.91],["about",118.91,119.23],["your",119.23,119.49],["preschool,",119.49,119.93],["please.",120.21,120.37]]},{"start":121.01,"end":126.47,"text":"Sure, Robert. Well, Susie's the right age. We take three and four-year-olds in classes","words":[["Sure,",121.01,121.31],["Robert.",121.41,121.63],["Well,",122.19,122.45],["Susie's",122.61,123.01],["the",123.01,123.15],["right",123.15,123.35],["age.",123.35,123.79],["We",124.17,124.37],["take",124.37,124.63],["three",124.63,125.05],["and",125.05,125.29],["four",125.29,125.53],["-year",125.53,125.71],["-olds",125.71,125.97],["in",125.97,126.11],["classes",126.11,126.47]]},{"start":126.47,"end":127.59,"text":"of 20 students.","words":[["of",126.47,126.73],["20",126.73,127.09],["students.",127.09,127.59]]},{"start":131.02,"end":138.36,"text":"The number of children in a class is 20, so 20 has been written in the space.","words":[["The",131.02,131.38],["number",131.38,131.74],["of",131.74,132.0],["children",132.0,132.46],["in",132.46,132.78],["a",132.78,132.92],["class",132.92,133.24],["is",133.24,133.88],["20,",133.88,134.36],["so",134.92,135.42],["20",135.42,136.18],["has",136.18,136.84],["been",136.84,137.16],["written",137.16,137.5],["in",137.5,137.8],["the",137.8,137.96],["space.",137.96,138.36]]},{"start":139.44,"end":146.0,"text":"Now we shall begin. You should answer the questions as you listen because you will not hear the","words":[["Now",139.44,140.1],["we",140.1,140.34],["shall",140.34,140.56],["begin.",140.56,140.94],["You",141.92,142.06],["should",142.06,142.24],["answer",142.24,142.56],["the",142.56,142.74],["questions",142.74,143.22],["as",143.22,143.7],["you",143.7,143.92],["listen",143.92,144.28],["because",144.28,144.92],["you",144.92,145.2],["will",145.2,145.36],["not",145.36,145.68],["hear",145.68,145.9],["the",145.9,146.0]]},{"start":146.0,"end":152.82,"text":"recording a second time. Listen carefully and answer questions one to five.","words":[["recording",146.0,146.46],["a",146.46,146.82],["second",146.82,147.08],["time.",147.08,147.6],["Listen",148.72,149.38],["carefully",149.38,149.84],["and",149.84,150.5],["answer",150.5,150.82],["questions",150.82,151.28],["one",151.28,151.98],["to",151.98,152.38],["five.",152.38,152.82]]},{"start":156.23,"end":159.17,"text":"Good morning Riverdale Preschool. Sally speaking.","words":[["Good",156.23,156.67],["morning",156.67,156.97],["Riverdale",156.97,157.51],["Preschool.",157.51,158.17],["Sally",158.43,158.75],["speaking.",158.75,159.17]]},{"start":159.71,"end":164.65,"text":"Hello. My name's Robert. I've got a four-year-old daughter called Susie and I'd like to get","words":[["Hello.",159.71,159.93],["My",160.37,160.59],["name's",160.59,160.89],["Robert.",160.89,161.09],["I've",161.55,161.77],["got",161.77,161.87],["a",161.87,162.01],["four",162.01,162.27],["-year",162.27,162.43],["-old",162.43,162.59],["daughter",162.59,162.93],["called",162.93,163.27],["Susie",163.27,163.95],["and",163.95,164.13],["I'd",164.13,164.27],["like",164.27,164.39],["to",164.39,164.53],["get",164.53,164.65]]},{"start":164.65,"end":166.75,"text":"some information about your preschool please.","words":[["some",164.65,164.79],["information",164.79,165.27],["about",165.27,165.63],["your",165.63,165.87],["preschool",165.87,166.35],["please.",166.35,166.75]]},{"start":166.75,"end":172.87,"text":"Sure, Robert. Well, Susie's the right age. We take three and four year olds in classes","words":[["Sure,",166.75,167.67],["Robert.",167.83,167.99],["Well,",168.59,168.87],["Susie's",169.01,169.41],["the",169.41,169.53],["right",169.53,169.75],["age.",169.75,170.19],["We",170.59,170.77],["take",170.77,171.01],["three",171.01,171.43],["and",171.43,171.67],["four",171.67,171.93],["year",171.93,172.11],["olds",172.11,172.33],["in",172.33,172.51],["classes",172.51,172.87]]},{"start":172.87,"end":174.05,"text":"of twenty students.","words":[["of",172.87,173.11],["twenty",173.11,173.45],["students.",173.45,174.05]]},{"start":174.23,"end":176.63,"text":"Oh, great. And how many teachers do you have?","words":[["Oh,",174.23,174.41],["great.",174.45,174.65],["And",175.11,175.33],["how",175.33,175.61],["many",175.61,175.77],["teachers",175.77,176.15],["do",176.15,176.35],["you",176.35,176.47],["have?",176.47,176.63]]},{"start":176.93,"end":181.99,"text":"We have two. The first group is taught by Mrs Oliver, and the second group is taken","words":[["We",176.93,177.09],["have",177.09,177.31],["two.",177.31,177.63],["The",178.29,178.43],["first",178.43,178.71],["group",178.71,178.93],["is",178.93,179.11],["taught",179.11,179.29],["by",179.29,179.53],["Mrs",179.53,179.77],["Oliver,",179.77,180.13],["and",180.51,180.85],["the",180.85,180.97],["second",180.97,181.25],["group",181.25,181.55],["is",181.55,181.73],["taken",181.73,181.99]]},{"start":181.99,"end":183.13,"text":"by Mrs Keo.","words":[["by",181.99,182.27],["Mrs",182.27,182.61],["Keo.",182.61,183.13]]},{"start":183.39,"end":188.11,"text":"Just a moment. I'll write that down. Could you spell the last name please? It's an unusual","words":[["Just",183.39,183.61],["a",183.61,183.77],["moment.",183.77,183.97],["I'll",184.17,184.25],["write",184.25,184.43],["that",184.43,184.63],["down.",184.63,184.99],["Could",185.55,185.73],["you",185.73,185.87],["spell",185.87,186.19],["the",186.19,186.39],["last",186.39,186.63],["name",186.63,186.89],["please?",186.89,187.19],["It's",187.51,187.71],["an",187.71,187.81],["unusual",187.81,188.11]]},{"start":188.11,"end":188.75,"text":"one, isn't it?","words":[["one,",188.11,188.41],["isn't",188.47,188.59],["it?",188.59,188.75]]},{"start":189.17,"end":192.35,"text":"Yes. It's K-E-O-G-H.","words":[["Yes.",189.17,189.55],["It's",190.15,190.47],["K",190.47,190.81],["-E",190.81,191.23],["-O",191.23,191.75],["-G",191.75,192.11],["-H.",192.11,192.35]]},{"start":192.99,"end":198.61,"text":"Okay, I've got that. Now, I know the children attend for two or three days a week.","words":[["Okay,",192.99,193.51],["I've",193.79,193.97],["got",193.97,194.09],["that.",194.09,194.31],["Now,",195.01,195.19],["I",195.67,195.77],["know",195.77,195.93],["the",195.93,196.09],["children",196.09,196.45],["attend",196.45,196.75],["for",196.75,197.23],["two",197.23,197.53],["or",197.53,197.65],["three",197.65,197.97],["days",197.97,198.25],["a",198.25,198.39],["week.",198.39,198.61]]},{"start":199.13,"end":205.55,"text":"That's right. The older ones, like Susie, are here for three days, which means 15 hours a week.","words":[["That's",199.13,199.45],["right.",199.45,199.67],["The",200.21,200.33],["older",200.33,200.57],["ones,",200.57,200.97],["like",201.13,201.43],["Susie,",201.43,201.97],["are",202.35,202.51],["here",202.51,202.65],["for",202.65,202.85],["three",202.85,203.17],["days,",203.17,203.65],["which",203.91,204.13],["means",204.13,204.39],["15",204.39,204.77],["hours",204.77,205.11],["a",205.11,205.35],["week.",205.35,205.55]]},{"start":206.07,"end":211.45,"text":"The younger ones, the three-year-olds, attend two days a week. That's a total of 10 hours.","words":[["The",206.07,206.19],["younger",206.19,206.45],["ones,",206.45,206.83],["the",207.07,207.19],["three",207.19,207.49],["-year",207.49,207.63],["-olds,",207.63,207.89],["attend",208.29,208.65],["two",208.65,209.03],["days",209.03,209.35],["a",209.35,209.59],["week.",209.59,209.79],["That's",210.01,210.27],["a",210.27,210.33],["total",210.33,210.55],["of",210.55,210.75],["10",210.75,211.01],["hours.",211.01,211.45]]},{"start":211.75,"end":213.53,"text":"And what do they do during that time?","words":[["And",211.75,211.99],["what",211.99,212.21],["do",212.21,212.37],["they",212.37,212.49],["do",212.49,212.73],["during",212.73,212.97],["that",212.97,213.19],["time?",213.19,213.53]]},{"start":214.17,"end":220.43,"text":"Well, half the day is spent outside and the children can run around and play games with their friends","words":[["Well,",214.17,214.69],["half",214.99,215.27],["the",215.27,215.45],["day",215.45,215.63],["is",215.63,215.81],["spent",215.81,216.01],["outside",216.01,216.71],["and",216.71,217.17],["the",217.17,217.27],["children",217.27,217.57],["can",217.57,217.87],["run",217.87,218.15],["around",218.15,218.55],["and",218.55,218.83],["play",218.83,219.11],["games",219.11,219.53],["with",219.53,219.75],["their",219.75,219.95],["friends",219.95,220.43]]},{"start":220.43,"end":224.27,"text":"or do a calmer activity, like painting for example.","words":[["or",220.43,221.13],["do",221.13,221.31],["a",221.31,221.43],["calmer",221.43,221.81],["activity,",221.81,222.39],["like",222.79,223.05],["painting",223.05,223.51],["for",223.51,223.85],["example.",223.85,224.27]]},{"start":224.95,"end":228.65,"text":"We have a great outside play area that we're improving all the time.","words":[["We",224.95,225.11],["have",225.11,225.25],["a",225.25,225.35],["great",225.35,225.61],["outside",225.61,226.11],["play",226.11,226.47],["area",226.47,226.97],["that",226.97,227.23],["we're",227.23,227.43],["improving",227.43,227.79],["all",227.79,228.11],["the",228.11,228.23],["time.",228.23,228.65]]},{"start":229.07,"end":231.97,"text":"Yes, we were walking past the other day and Susie noticed.","words":[["Yes,",229.07,229.35],["we",229.63,229.85],["were",229.85,229.97],["walking",229.97,230.25],["past",230.25,230.63],["the",230.63,230.81],["other",230.81,230.91],["day",230.91,231.19],["and",231.19,231.31],["Susie",231.31,231.69],["noticed.",231.69,231.97]]},{"start":232.53,"end":234.63,"text":"You've recently put in a new slide, haven't you?","words":[["You've",232.53,232.81],["recently",232.81,233.09],["put",233.09,233.39],["in",233.39,233.53],["a",233.53,233.67],["new",233.67,233.73],["slide,",233.73,234.09],["haven't",234.31,234.45],["you?",234.45,234.63]]},{"start":234.93,"end":239.49,"text":"Yes, we're really pleased with it. It's a big one and the children love it.","words":[["Yes,",234.93,235.25],["we're",235.57,235.87],["really",235.87,236.15],["pleased",236.15,236.47],["with",236.47,236.77],["it.",236.77,236.97],["It's",237.31,237.53],["a",237.53,237.63],["big",237.63,237.77],["one",237.77,238.01],["and",238.01,238.23],["the",238.23,238.35],["children",238.35,238.75],["love",238.75,239.21],["it.",239.21,239.49]]},{"start":239.61,"end":241.55,"text":"And are you thinking of adding anything else outdoors?","words":[["And",239.61,239.77],["are",239.77,239.85],["you",239.85,239.93],["thinking",239.93,240.21],["of",240.21,240.43],["adding",240.43,240.59],["anything",240.59,240.93],["else",240.93,241.15],["outdoors?",241.15,241.55]]},{"start":242.11,"end":246.21,"text":"Well, we were hoping to build a playhouse, but that was too expensive.","words":[["Well,",242.11,242.55],["we",242.59,242.75],["were",242.75,243.01],["hoping",243.01,243.41],["to",243.41,243.65],["build",243.65,243.83],["a",243.83,243.99],["playhouse,",243.99,244.63],["but",244.85,245.07],["that",245.07,245.25],["was",245.25,245.45],["too",245.45,245.65],["expensive.",245.65,246.21]]},{"start":246.21,"end":252.05,"text":"So we're now making plans for a garden where the children will be able to grow flowers and vegetables.","words":[["So",246.21,246.93],["we're",246.93,247.19],["now",247.19,247.41],["making",247.41,247.81],["plans",247.81,248.17],["for",248.17,248.43],["a",248.43,248.57],["garden",248.57,248.89],["where",248.89,249.37],["the",249.37,249.51],["children",249.51,249.83],["will",249.83,250.09],["be",250.09,250.25],["able",250.25,250.41],["to",250.41,250.57],["grow",250.57,250.81],["flowers",250.81,251.35],["and",251.35,251.59],["vegetables.",251.59,252.05]]},{"start":252.71,"end":255.23,"text":"Lovely. And what else do the children do?","words":[["Lovely.",252.71,252.99],["And",253.39,253.65],["what",253.65,254.19],["else",254.19,254.41],["do",254.41,254.53],["the",254.53,254.63],["children",254.63,254.93],["do?",254.93,255.23]]},{"start":256.11,"end":258.35,"text":"Well the other half of the day is spent indoors.","words":[["Well",256.11,256.29],["the",256.29,256.43],["other",256.43,256.59],["half",256.59,256.85],["of",256.85,257.01],["the",257.01,257.11],["day",257.11,257.33],["is",257.33,257.49],["spent",257.49,257.75],["indoors.",257.75,258.35]]},{"start":259.13,"end":262.13,"text":"This year the children seem to be very interested in music","words":[["This",259.13,259.35],["year",259.35,259.61],["the",259.61,259.75],["children",259.75,260.07],["seem",260.07,260.41],["to",260.41,260.55],["be",260.55,260.69],["very",260.69,260.97],["interested",260.97,261.47],["in",261.47,261.71],["music",261.71,262.13]]},{"start":262.13,"end":265.67,"text":"so the teachers are doing a lot of activities related to that.","words":[["so",262.13,262.85],["the",262.85,263.01],["teachers",263.01,263.31],["are",263.31,263.51],["doing",263.51,263.69],["a",263.69,263.85],["lot",263.85,263.99],["of",263.99,264.07],["activities",264.07,264.69],["related",264.69,265.09],["to",265.09,265.45],["that.",265.45,265.67]]},{"start":266.31,"end":269.09,"text":"Last year there seemed to be more of an interest in dancing.","words":[["Last",266.31,266.59],["year",266.59,266.89],["there",266.89,267.07],["seemed",267.07,267.31],["to",267.31,267.43],["be",267.43,267.55],["more",267.55,267.75],["of",267.75,267.89],["an",267.89,267.97],["interest",267.97,268.27],["in",268.27,268.55],["dancing.",268.55,269.09]]},{"start":269.43,"end":271.47,"text":"Well Susie would love either of those.","words":[["Well",269.43,269.61],["Susie",269.61,270.15],["would",270.15,270.31],["love",270.31,270.57],["either",270.57,270.99],["of",270.99,271.21],["those.",271.21,271.47]]},{"start":272.05,"end":275.47,"text":"The teachers may sometimes play quiet games with the children","words":[["The",272.05,272.37],["teachers",272.37,272.67],["may",272.67,272.99],["sometimes",272.99,273.43],["play",273.43,273.87],["quiet",273.87,274.33],["games",274.33,274.71],["with",274.71,274.95],["the",274.95,275.07],["children",275.07,275.47]]},{"start":275.47,"end":278.51,"text":"but we always make time for a story each day.","words":[["but",275.47,275.65],["we",275.65,276.21],["always",276.21,276.49],["make",276.49,276.75],["time",276.75,277.07],["for",277.07,277.27],["a",277.27,277.41],["story",277.41,277.79],["each",277.79,278.19],["day.",278.19,278.51]]},{"start":278.99,"end":281.41,"text":"It's a very important part of the program here.","words":[["It's",278.99,279.23],["a",279.23,279.29],["very",279.29,279.47],["important",279.47,279.95],["part",279.95,280.25],["of",280.25,280.47],["the",280.47,280.57],["program",280.57,281.01],["here.",281.01,281.41]]},{"start":281.73,"end":282.47,"text":"Yes, of course.","words":[["Yes,",281.73,282.01],["of",282.13,282.25],["course.",282.25,282.47]]},{"start":285.98,"end":288.14,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the conversation,","words":[["Before",285.98,286.28],["you",286.28,286.58],["hear",286.58,286.82],["the",286.82,286.98],["rest",286.98,287.26],["of",287.26,287.4],["the",287.4,287.5],["conversation,",287.5,288.14]]},{"start":288.66,"end":294.02,"text":"you have some time to look at questions 6 to 10 on page 2.","words":[["you",288.66,288.86],["have",288.86,289.14],["some",289.14,289.36],["time",289.36,289.72],["to",289.72,290.0],["look",290.0,290.16],["at",290.16,290.32],["questions",290.32,290.74],["6",290.74,291.68],["to",291.68,292.08],["10",292.08,292.58],["on",292.58,293.26],["page",293.26,293.54],["2.",293.54,294.02]]},{"start":319.38,"end":323.28,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 6 to 10.","words":[["Now",319.38,319.72],["listen",319.72,320.16],["and",320.16,320.74],["answer",320.74,321.08],["questions",321.08,321.56],["6",321.56,322.42],["to",322.42,322.8],["10.",322.8,323.28]]},{"start":326.6,"end":329.76,"text":"Now, I'd like to ask you about the fees if that's okay.","words":[["Now,",326.6,326.96],["I'd",327.32,327.54],["like",327.54,327.7],["to",327.7,327.88],["ask",327.88,328.1],["you",328.1,328.22],["about",328.22,328.42],["the",328.42,328.58],["fees",328.58,329.02],["if",329.02,329.26],["that's",329.26,329.52],["okay.",329.52,329.76]]},{"start":330.34,"end":333.8,"text":"Sure. We actually had to put them up this term, I'm afraid.","words":[["Sure.",330.34,330.7],["We",331.22,331.6],["actually",331.6,331.92],["had",331.92,332.14],["to",332.14,332.28],["put",332.28,332.42],["them",332.42,332.56],["up",332.56,332.72],["this",332.72,332.96],["term,",332.96,333.26],["I'm",333.32,333.5],["afraid.",333.5,333.8]]},{"start":333.8,"end":338.96,"text":"Yes. I heard from a friend of mine that it used to be $420 for the term, but it's just","words":[["Yes.",333.8,334.34],["I",334.72,334.88],["heard",334.88,335.06],["from",335.06,335.24],["a",335.24,335.38],["friend",335.38,335.52],["of",335.52,335.68],["mine",335.68,335.9],["that",335.9,336.04],["it",336.04,336.16],["used",336.16,336.3],["to",336.3,336.44],["be",336.44,336.56],["$420",336.56,337.48],["for",337.48,338.02],["the",338.02,338.14],["term,",338.14,338.42],["but",338.56,338.64],["it's",338.64,338.8],["just",338.8,338.96]]},{"start":338.96,"end":341.38,"text":"gone up to $470. Is that right?","words":[["gone",338.96,339.2],["up",339.2,339.3],["to",339.3,339.46],["$470.",339.46,340.48],["Is",340.86,341.02],["that",341.02,341.14],["right?",341.14,341.38]]},{"start":341.86,"end":348.32,"text":"Yes. We had to add the extra $50 to cover costs. Things got a lot more expensive last","words":[["Yes.",341.86,342.22],["We",342.7,342.88],["had",342.88,343.08],["to",343.08,343.26],["add",343.26,343.56],["the",343.56,343.76],["extra",343.76,344.2],["$50",344.2,344.56],["to",344.56,345.14],["cover",345.14,345.42],["costs.",345.42,345.98],["Things",346.56,346.84],["got",346.84,347.06],["a",347.06,347.16],["lot",347.16,347.3],["more",347.3,347.46],["expensive",347.46,347.86],["last",347.86,348.32]]},{"start":348.32,"end":348.68,"text":"year.","words":[["year.",348.32,348.68]]},{"start":348.78,"end":354.12,"text":"I understand. And I think the fees are still quite reasonable. Another school I've spoken","words":[["I",348.78,349.1],["understand.",349.1,349.86],["And",350.6,350.88],["I",350.88,351.08],["think",351.08,351.24],["the",351.24,351.4],["fees",351.4,351.6],["are",351.6,351.8],["still",351.8,351.98],["quite",351.98,352.24],["reasonable.",352.24,352.6],["Another",353.1,353.4],["school",353.4,353.62],["I've",353.62,353.84],["spoken",353.84,354.12]]},{"start":354.12,"end":356.32,"text":"to charges $500 per term.","words":[["to",354.12,354.4],["charges",354.4,354.76],["$500",354.76,355.52],["per",355.52,356.06],["term.",356.06,356.32]]},{"start":356.74,"end":357.46,"text":"Oh really?","words":[["Oh",356.74,357.04],["really?",357.04,357.46]]},{"start":357.84,"end":361.94,"text":"My friend also told me that his daughter went on a trip to the local zoo and that","words":[["My",357.84,358.06],["friend",358.06,358.24],["also",358.24,358.52],["told",358.52,358.8],["me",358.8,359.06],["that",359.06,359.42],["his",359.42,359.54],["daughter",359.54,359.78],["went",359.78,360.04],["on",360.04,360.22],["a",360.22,360.36],["trip",360.36,360.52],["to",360.52,360.68],["the",360.68,360.8],["local",360.8,361.06],["zoo",361.06,361.42],["and",361.42,361.78],["that",361.78,361.94]]},{"start":361.94,"end":364.24,"text":"the cost of that was covered in the fees. Is that right?","words":[["the",361.94,362.08],["cost",362.08,362.3],["of",362.3,362.44],["that",362.44,362.58],["was",362.58,362.74],["covered",362.74,363.02],["in",363.02,363.18],["the",363.18,363.32],["fees.",363.32,363.64],["Is",363.76,363.84],["that",363.84,364.0],["right?",364.0,364.24]]},{"start":364.64,"end":370.38,"text":"Yes, we did that last year but we'll be going to a farm this year instead. We vary it so,","words":[["Yes,",364.64,364.9],["we",365.26,365.44],["did",365.44,365.6],["that",365.6,365.78],["last",365.78,366.12],["year",366.12,366.42],["but",366.42,366.6],["we'll",366.6,366.78],["be",366.78,366.9],["going",366.9,367.12],["to",367.12,367.32],["a",367.32,367.48],["farm",367.48,367.76],["this",367.76,368.08],["year",368.08,368.34],["instead.",368.34,368.68],["We",369.32,369.5],["vary",369.5,369.84],["it",369.84,370.1],["so,",370.1,370.38]]},{"start":370.54,"end":373.04,"text":"for example, we may go to the theatre next year.","words":[["for",370.54,370.64],["example,",370.64,371.04],["we",371.32,371.42],["may",371.42,371.6],["go",371.6,371.78],["to",371.78,371.9],["the",371.9,372.06],["theatre",372.06,372.38],["next",372.38,372.7],["year.",372.7,373.04]]},{"start":373.22,"end":374.66,"text":"OK, it sounds like fun.","words":[["OK,",373.22,373.54],["it",373.86,373.98],["sounds",373.98,374.16],["like",374.16,374.38],["fun.",374.38,374.66]]},{"start":375.12,"end":381.02,"text":"Also included in the price is membership of a special library. Children can borrow a toy","words":[["Also",375.12,375.46],["included",375.46,375.96],["in",375.96,376.22],["the",376.22,376.32],["price",376.32,376.66],["is",376.66,376.96],["membership",376.96,377.3],["of",377.3,377.74],["a",377.74,377.86],["special",377.86,378.22],["library.",378.22,378.82],["Children",379.5,379.8],["can",379.8,380.12],["borrow",380.12,380.52],["a",380.52,380.76],["toy",380.76,381.02]]},{"start":381.02,"end":385.68,"text":"and keep it for a week and choose a different one the following week. It's very popular.","words":[["and",381.02,381.38],["keep",381.38,381.6],["it",381.6,381.72],["for",381.72,381.9],["a",381.9,382.06],["week",382.06,382.26],["and",382.26,382.84],["choose",382.84,383.08],["a",383.08,383.26],["different",383.26,383.48],["one",383.48,383.76],["the",383.76,383.96],["following",383.96,384.22],["week.",384.22,384.54],["It's",384.86,385.04],["very",385.04,385.26],["popular.",385.26,385.68]]},{"start":385.92,"end":390.58,"text":"What a great idea. We would certainly make use of that system if we enrol. Now,","words":[["What",385.92,386.02],["a",386.02,386.12],["great",386.12,386.38],["idea.",386.38,386.82],["We",387.24,387.38],["would",387.38,387.